# Phase 8a (docs/phase8a-brief.md 3.5, 4.8): a minute step on the face
# pushes exactly one digits band (update unlit:digits y=62 h=68) and
# nothing else. Needs the host's real clock (sim_clock rtc), so it waits
# a little over one minute (the face wakes once a minute, on the boundary
# ui_unlit_timeout() computes) and the digits shot is timing-dependent.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p8a-unlit-minute.script
# needs: library
# trace: unlit
# unlit-digits: 1 2
# timeout: 150
# golden: skip face_a face_b
# nolog: splash-pass
#
# Window = 62 s: one minute boundary, or two when the face is entered in
# the last 2 s of a minute (hence "1 2"); each is exactly one band
# (check_trace.py p8a-unlit: bands only inside enter/exit, y=62 h=68).

wait 4000
sim_clock rtc
clock_format 24
battery 100
backlight_expire
wait 3500
shot face_a
wait 62000
shot face_b         # the host's next minute
key SELECT
wait 800
quit
